# --- CUDA / Profiling artifacts -----------------------------------------
# Raw nsys / ncu traces are large; opt-in per file with `git add -f` if a
# specific trace is worth preserving.
*.nsys-rep
*.qdrep
*.qdrep-nsys
*.qdstrm
*.ncu-rep
*.sqlite
core.*

# Hand-built CUDA extension caches (load_inline / setuptools)
torch_extensions/
.cache/

# --- Per-experiment results that shouldn't be committed ------------------
# By default we DO commit small svgs / csvs under playground/**/results/
# because they're cited from blog posts. Uncomment the next line to flip
# that policy:
# playground/**/results/
